      "issue": "The claim states 'Desk entries do not log every field operation or identify the point of interruption.' The evidence (IA-S01) explicitly notes that desk entries 'do not identify the point at which the air supply was interrupted' and are approximate. However, it does not establish whether they fail to log *every* field operation; this is an inference beyond the text.",
