      "supported": false,
      "issue": "The claim states 'No documented confirmation of understanding regarding root cause assessment or response steps is present.' The evidence (IA-S03) notes no interview concerning fatigue/workload/intent. However, the absence of an interview does not prove that *no* discussion occurred; it only proves no formal record exists.",
      "evidenceNeeded": "A statement from a witness or supervisor confirming whether informal discussions about root cause or response steps took place between 10:02 and 10:07, even if unrecorded formally.",
      "question": "Can any available testimony confirm whether the crew discussed how to handle the air loss beyond pausing work?"
    },
